### 결제 요청
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456"
}

### PG 콜백 (SUCCESS)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "20250816:TR:abc123",
  "orderId": "000001",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": 278000,
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "reason": "정상 승인되었습니다."
}

### PG 콜백 (FAILED)
POST {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionKey": "20250816:TR:def456",
  "orderId": "000001",
  "cardType": "SAMSUNG",
  "cardNo": "1234-5678-9012-3456",
  "amount": 278000,
  "status": "FAILED",
  "reason": "한도초과입니다."
}

### 결제 상세 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/payments/1
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123

### 주문별 결제 목록 조회
GET {{commerce-api}}/api/v1/orders/1/payments
X-Loopers-LoginId: testuser
X-Loopers-LoginPw: password123
